stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> upcoming: imported / built / added
  upcoming --> live: Start game
  upcoming --> postponed: Postpone
  upcoming --> cancelled: Cancel game
  live --> final: Finish game (needs both scores;<br/>knockout needs a winner)
  live --> upcoming: Back to not started
  final --> live: Reopen (fix the score)
  postponed --> upcoming: Back on the schedule
  cancelled --> upcoming: Back on the schedule
  final --> [*]
  note right of final: winner_side generated · next games filled by app.sk_resolve
